<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Might Not Be</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Backflips in a Restaurant (Deluxe)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2k3DRZRm9izXjhCPkxGPee</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.570" end="00:08.570">Hey sir, I, I don't know what to do I've tried everything, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.900" end="00:19.070">I'm tryna be the boy, the one that understands</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.070" end="00:22.230">The one to call your favorite person in the end, but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.230" end="00:24.800">I'm stuck in limbo from a lover to a friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.800" end="00:29.070">Could I have some info? Give me a window, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.070" end="00:35.050">We're not saint, that ain't real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.050" end="00:39.930">You love me now, what I fear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.930" end="00:43.100">You bring me in (you bring me in)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.100" end="00:46.350">Toss me out (toss me out)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.350" end="00:49.510">Hold my tongue (hold my tongue)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.510" end="00:52.570">Kiss my mouth (kiss my mouth)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.570" end="00:55.810">It's unclear of what you want from me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.810" end="00:58.960">Your depiction of the one you need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.960" end="01:05.790">Might not be (might not be), not be me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.790" end="01:08.290">I'm falling with nobody to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.290" end="01:11.370">Except myself, it's all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.370" end="01:15.100">Old state of roasting the glass and rosy cheeks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.100" end="01:18.930">Dumbfounded at every word you speak, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.930" end="01:24.310">Ever have I ever felt a love like this (love like this)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.310" end="01:27.710">Oh, no, no (oh, no, no)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.710" end="01:30.380">What I fear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.380" end="01:33.600">You bring me in (you bring me in)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.600" end="01:36.750">Toss me out (toss me out)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.750" end="01:40.050">Hold my tongue (hold my tongue)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.050" end="01:43.250">Kiss my mouth (kiss my mouth)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.250" end="01:46.450">It's unclear of what you want from me (from me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.450" end="01:49.680">Your depiction of the one you need (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.680" end="01:56.320">Might not be (might not be), not be me (not be me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.320" end="01:57.820">Fuck it (ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.820" end="02:04.230">I'll stay right here with you (ah, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.230" end="02:12.180">I'll stay right here with you, yeah (ah, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.180" end="02:18.140">I'll stay right here with you (ah, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.140" end="02:23.700">Oh, no, no (ahh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.700" end="02:27.700" /></div></body></tt>